    {
      "item_id": "summary.abstract",
      "kind": "summary",
      "gold": [
        "The project manager opened the kickoff meeting, and the marketing expert, industrial designer and user interface designer introduced themselves and their responsibilities.",
        "The project manager presented the project: a wearable step counter for seniors. Management has set a selling price of 30 euros, a maximum production cost of 12.50 euros per unit including the attachment, and a profit aim of 50 million euros on the international market.",
        "The team agreed that the device must be simple and have a big, high-contrast display. The wearing position (wrist, clip or pendant), fall detection and the battery type were discussed and left open.",
        "A task to research what seniors find readable was first given to the user interface designer and later moved to the marketing expert, who can use the marketing user panel.",
        "A family companion app was suggested but met objections on simplicity and cost. The need to check component costs was raised but nobody took it on."
      ],
      "reviewer_1": {
        "name": "",
        "decision": null,
        "edit": null,
        "comment": ""
      },
      "reviewer_2": {
