      }
    },
    {
      "item_id": "summary.actions",
      "kind": "summary",
      "gold": [
        "The marketing expert will research readable font sizes and contrast for seniors using the marketing user panel. This task was reassigned from the user interface designer.",
        "The industrial designer will look into attachment options, comparing cost and sturdiness.",
        "The user interface designer will work on the interface functions, including the buttons and what the display shows.",
        "The project manager will send round the minutes.",
        "Checking the cost of components such as the sensor and screen was raised, but no owner was assigned."
      ],
      "reviewer_1": {
