      "gold": [
        "The wearing position (wrist, belt or pocket clip, or pendant) has not been decided.",
        "Fall detection was proposed but not decided. Concerns are complexity and the 12.50 euro cost limit.",
        "Battery type (replaceable coin cell or rechargeable) is undecided.",
        "Competing basic pedometers sell for 10 to 15 euros. Component costs are unknown, and nobody is assigned to check them.",
        "The number of buttons is not settled."
